### GET request to example server
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suggestion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yard": "YRD1",
  "container_number": "ALFI000001",
  "container_size": 20,
  "container_height": 8.6,
  "container_type": "DRY"
}
